    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NILE: Roger that. Nile motions her team forward. GITA, a young Afghan woman in US military fatigues, follows. She is their TRANSLATOR.\nNILE: Keep it respectful.\nDIZZY: Don't we always?\nNILE: Never hurts to repeat it.",
      "JORDAN: You need to stop tripping.\nDIZZY: I know what I saw.\nJORDAN: A little blood can look like a lot. Adrenaline flying, everyone was seeing shit they didn't.\nDIZZY: I was holding her fucking neck together in my hands. Jordan stops, locks up on Dizzy.",
      "NILE: Who are you?\nANDY: Andromache the Scythian. As Nile's eyes widen, Andy deftly KNOCKS HER OUT with the gun.\nANDY: But you can call me Andy.",
      "NILE: I thought you said we were going to Paris?\nANDY: This is Goussainville. Just outside of Paris. Been abandoned for fifty years.\nANDY: That.",
      "NILE: And you're the oldest?\nANDY: Yeah.\nNILE: How old are you?\nANDY: Old."
    ]
  },
